# A dated edition's payload is built from tapio_register/data/register.yaml by
# `tapio-register release`, not stored. Only the manifest is kept, and it
# carries the digests the rebuilt payload is checked against -- committing the
# payload would bury a three-line concept change in a fourteen-thousand-line
# diff. See register/README.md.
releases/*/register.yaml
releases/*/register.ttl
releases/*/register.jsonld

# `tapio-register seed-finto` output is a review queue, and a harvest is
# committed only when it is the one a register change was reviewed from.
